Hi {Owner},

I build websites for security, camera and alarm companies around {City}. I couldn't find a way for a business owner to request a site survey from {Business Name}, read your monitoring terms or see your camera installs.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a site survey request with floor plan upload, a camera coverage planner, a plain-language monitoring page, an access control page and a takeover page for people switching providers, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
